<title>USA: Capital City Bank Group Q4 earnings rise.</title>
<headline>Capital City Bank Group Q4 earnings rise.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CAPITAL CITY BANK GROUP INC.</p>
<p>FINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS:</p>
<p> For the year ended			    1996		1995</p>
<p> Earnings per share			   $ 3.96	   $ 3.34</p>
<p> Return on equity			     13.48%	   12.32%</p>
<p> Return on assets				1.25%	    1.25%</p>
<p> Net interest margin			   5.21%	    5.22%</p>
<p> Net charge offs as a % of average loans  .27%	     .32%</p>
<p>Nonperforming Assets as a % of loans</p>
<p>  and ORE					   .66%	    1.28%</p>
<p> For the quarter ended		    12/31/96	 12/31/95</p>
<p> Earnings per share			    $ 1.03	   $ .86</p>
<p> Return on equity				13.47%	  12.08%</p>
<p> Return on assets				 1.15%	   1.25%</p>
<p> Net interest margin			    5.03%	   5.22%</p>
<p> Net charge offs as a % of average loans   .38%	    .50%</p>
<p>Nonperforming Assets as a % of loans</p>
<p>  and ORE					    .66%	   1.28%</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
